
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#09090b">
<title>NEYO — Critical Ops</title>
<meta name="description" content="NEYO. Competitive Critical Ops player profile.">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:#09090b;color:#f5f5f5;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
:root{--red:#ed263b;--muted:#92929b}
header{height:76px;padding:0 8%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #242429;background:#0c0c10}
.logo{font-size:27px;font-weight:1000;letter-spacing:5px}
.logo span{color:var(--red)}
nav{display:flex;gap:25px}
nav a{color:#aaa;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px}
nav a:hover{color:var(--red)}
.hero{min-height:570px;padding:100px 10%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 55%,#64101e 0%,#250a11 24%,#09090b 65%)}
.hero:after{content:"NEYO";position:absolute;right:-35px;bottom:-50px;font-size:clamp(150px,30vw,360px);font-weight:1000;color:#ffffff05;letter-spacing:-15px;pointer-events:none}
.tag{color:var(--red);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:bold}
h1{font-size:clamp(75px,15vw,155px);font-weight:1000;letter-spacing:10px;margin:20px 0;line-height:1}
h1 span{color:var(--red)}
.hero p{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#aaa}
.line{width:75px;height:4px;background:var(--red);margin:30px 0}
.btn{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--red);padding:15px 25px;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;width:max-content;margin-top:30px;transition:.25s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--red)}
section{padding:90px 10%;border-bottom:1px solid #202026}
.eyebrow{color:var(--red);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:4px;margin-bottom:15px}
h2{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:35px}
.about{color:#aaa;line-height:2;max-width:700px;font-size:15px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.card{background:#111115;border:1px solid #292930;padding:30px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.card:before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:3px;height:100%;background:var(--red)}
.number{font-size:43px;font-weight:1000}
.label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
.achievements{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:15px}
.item{background:#111115;padding:24px;border:1px solid #27272d}
.item b{font-size:16px}
.item p{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:9px;line-height:1.6}
.item:before{content:"✦";color:var(--red);margin-right:12px}
.note{font-size:11px;color:#777;margin-top:20px}
footer{padding:40px 10%;text-align:center;color:#777;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px}
footer span{color:var(--red)}
@media(max-width:650px){
header{padding:0 5%;height:65px}
nav{gap:12px}
nav a{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px}
.logo{font-size:21px}
.hero{min-height:470px;padding:75px 7%}
.hero p{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px}
section{padding:65px 7%}
.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
.card{padding:22px 15px}
.number{font-size:34px}
.achievements{grid-template-columns:1fr}
h2{font-size:25px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
.hero .tag{animation:fade .8s ease both}
.hero h1{animation:fade 1s ease both}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">NEYO<span>.</span></div>
<nav>
<a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
<a href="#stats">STATS</a>
<a href="#career">CAREER</a>
</nav>
</header>

<main>
<div class="hero">
<div class="tag">CRITICAL OPS / PLAYER PROFILE</div>
<h1>NEYO<span>.</span></h1>
<p>PRECISION. CONTROL. DOMINANCE.</p>
<div class="line"></div>
<a class="btn" href="#about">DISCOVER PLAYER ↗</a>
</div>

